      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Data Table CRUD\n\nNormalizes and routes **data table operations** \u2014 used by the Shorts Dispatcher agent as a tool and by webhooks for direct API access.\n\n### Entry points\n\n- **Webhooks** \u2014 `yt-create`, `yt-wright`, `yt-update`, `yt-get`, `yt-remove` (direct API calls)\n- **Execute Workflow Trigger** \u2014 called by the Shorts Dispatcher agent as a tool (agent tool mode)\n\n### How it works\n\n1. **Normalize input** \u2014 the `Normalize Input` code node handles both entry paths:\n   - Webhook: data comes under `$json.body`\n   - Agent tool: data comes directly as `$json`\n   Extracts `operation`, validates it, checks required fields per operation type.\n\n2. **Validate** \u2014 throws if:\n   - `operation` is missing or not one of: `create`, `write`, `update`, `get`, `remove`\n   - `id` is missing for non-create operations\n   - `row` is missing for write/update/create\n   - `match.id` is missing for update\n   - `row.data` is not an array for write\n\n3. **Route via Switch** \u2014 dispatches to the correct operation:\n   - **create** \u2014 `POST /api/v1/data-tables` (create a new table)\n   - **write** \u2014 `POST /api/v1/data-tables/<id>/rows` (insert rows)\n   - **update** \u2014 native dataTable update node (update existing rows by match)\n   - **get** \u2014 `GET /api/v1/data-tables/<id>/rows` (read rows)\n   - **remove** \u2014 `DELETE /api/v1/data-tables/<id>` (delete a table)\n\n4. **Respond** \u2014 all paths return through a single `Respond to Webhook` node\n\n### Used by\n\nThe Shorts Dispatcher agent calls this as a tool to:\n- Lock/unlock Shorts_Production rows (`update` with `Working`)\n- Save enriched Scenes JSON (`update` with `Scenes`)\n- Queue ComfyUI Jobs rows (`write` to ComfyUI Jobs table)\n- Mark rows as queued (`update` with `Status`)",
        "height": 540,
        "width": 720,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
